@startuml
title State Machine - Complaint status (server-enforced, lib/server/workflow.ts)

[*] --> Open : Student submits\n/ triage suggested
Open --> UnderReview : review\n[Hostel Supervisor, own hostel]
Reopened --> UnderReview : review\n[Hostel Supervisor, own hostel]
UnderReview --> UnderReview : review again\n(re-adjust triage)
UnderReview --> Forwarded : forward\n[Hostel Supervisor]
Forwarded --> InProgress : progress\n[Maintenance Office]
InProgress --> Resolved : resolve [note given]\n[Maintenance Office]
Resolved --> Closed : confirm\n[Student, owner]
Resolved --> Reopened : reopen [reason given]\n[Student, owner]
Closed --> Reopened : reopen [reason given]\n[Student, owner]
Closed --> [*]

state Open : entry / notify supervisor
state UnderReview : entry / notify student (on status change)
state Forwarded : entry / notify Maintenance + student
state InProgress : entry / notify student (MaintenanceStarted)
state Resolved : entry / notify student (pending confirmation)
state Closed : entry / notify supervisor + Maintenance
state Reopened : entry / notify supervisor + Maintenance

note "Any other action, or the right action\nby the wrong role, is rejected:\n409 Conflict (status) / 403 Forbidden (role).\nEach transition runs in a Firestore\ntransaction and writes an audit log." as N
@enduml
